{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3000_place", "source_sha256": "3049bd9429cb91d0cec7ee49a32c3e03ffd1aff5d93eb4f41f01b0ac001b4436", "ja": "遊園地", "zh": "游乐园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3001_p", "source_sha256": "ef1582278c8dc468b3fbfc8db65c2563be687bc1e9e2b387dd83ed6b9f48c786", "ja": "（今日のロケは、『逃げろ！　遊園地ロワイヤル！』。\nアイドル達が、本気で鬼ごっこする番組だ……）", "zh": "（今天要拍的外景是『逃吧！皇家游乐园！』，\n是偶像们认真玩鬼抓人的节目……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3002_028ari", "source_sha256": "35a1d7bdb7f0c9f6d24757ecbd08207636e925b7beb2580a1086e43599cf466a", "ja": "ムフフ♪　こういう企画はありさにお任せです！\nありさ、体力にはあんまり自信ありませんが……。", "zh": "唔呼呼♪这种企划就交给亚利沙吧！\n虽然亚利沙对体力没什么信心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3003_028ari", "source_sha256": "6a42f5669a1e3f31e1f17a889fbe9d790c517e52ae5d645c9a539b5424d7084d", "ja": "アイドルちゃんのおっかけで鍛えたこの足で、\n見事、鬼から逃げきって賞金を手にしますよ～っ！", "zh": "但亚利沙会用追着偶像宝贝跑而锻炼出来的双腿，\n漂亮地逃过鬼的追捕，赢得奖金喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3004_p", "source_sha256": "dc10aff19294f4143e3e60a8c2554ae766aa232ea6351fdf8e758336859d9239", "ja": "ちょっと待った、亜利沙。\nちゃんと作戦は考えてあるんだろうな？", "zh": "等一下，亚利沙，\n你应该有好好思考作战计划吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3005_p", "source_sha256": "1a70ed10369e83493afc4fc4a79019cb0f5db8259dc95f60e9f405813f210f94", "ja": "俺が思うに、この番組で、最後まで逃げ切るには……", "zh": "在我看来，要在这个节目中存活到最后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3006", "source_sha256": "d1ed54e29486776ff7d6316b1e31d8c2abc670c652912a75aa29382ae0e67c64", "ja": "誰かと手を組む", "zh": "必须和别人联手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3007", "source_sha256": "e094d3310be93fcee254de74372a34a83ed47b87c59bc770d2819f09ddfb2604", "ja": "気配を消して体力温存", "zh": "必须隐匿行踪，保留体力", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3100_p", "source_sha256": "4edf91e27b3ecbd4476679bdbfa1c3935eeb4b02e018ba6ddee79bd201b7dee0", "ja": "誰か、協力者を見つけた方がいいぞ。\n連絡を取り合って、ペアで行動するんだ。", "zh": "应该要找个合作对象比较好喔。\n彼此保持联络、组队行动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3101_028ari", "source_sha256": "07e2a321fdeb366c502372b11a301c8c07dc9bd98c4e90a0cdfd81f6bccddcef", "ja": "はっ！　つまりこれは、\n憧れのアイドルちゃんと距離を縮めるチャンス……！？", "zh": "啊！也就是说，这是……\n和憧憬的偶像宝贝拉近距离的机会……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3102_028ari", "source_sha256": "7102327381c0fb05593cfc792ef35238379494163c148125700b1dd628c7f669", "ja": "本番が楽しみになってきました！\n誰とペアを組ませてもらいましょう……ムフフ♪", "zh": "亚利沙开始期待正式拍摄了！\n要找谁来组队呢……唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3200_p", "source_sha256": "4edf91e27b3ecbd4476679bdbfa1c3935eeb4b02e018ba6ddee79bd201b7dee0", "ja": "誰か、協力者を見つけた方がいいぞ。\n連絡を取り合って、ペアで行動するんだ。", "zh": "应该要找个合作对象比较好喔。\n彼此保持联络、组队行动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3201_028ari", "source_sha256": "947f4fd475df17940a7574e8c87a2d950929f93a66d87ea2a86c5325a37dfac4", "ja": "おおっ、なるほど！　よ～し、ありさと行動してくれる\n優しいアイドルちゃんをゲットしますよ～！", "zh": "喔喔，原来如此！好～要找一个愿意和\n亚利沙一起行动的温柔偶像宝贝啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3300_p", "source_sha256": "e177dd65ff7f3fb7e0229fcc9a182c65a4fbbc8e1ef6712f0951a2598bfd5a44", "ja": "なにしろ長いロケだからな。\n途中でへばらないよう、体力温存を心がけるんだ。", "zh": "毕竟录影时间很长，\n为了避免在中途筋疲力竭，应该多注意保留体力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3301_028ari", "source_sha256": "fcfab6f660a7813f44d41e293616d4c09f4763843d1f89af4470fecfb5037671", "ja": "了解ですっ！　ムフフ♪　\nありさ、実は潜伏も得意なんです♪", "zh": "了解！唔呼呼♪\n亚利沙其实也很擅长潜伏♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3302_028ari", "source_sha256": "e70bdbc5d55c5d9c5d02d98cfe3adee6b157edd902893d28217a30c9080d4d38", "ja": "ありさのスキルと{$P$}さんの作戦で\n優勝は間違いナシですねっ♪", "zh": "有亚利沙的技能加上{$P$}先生的\n作战计划，肯定胜券在握呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3400_p", "source_sha256": "e177dd65ff7f3fb7e0229fcc9a182c65a4fbbc8e1ef6712f0951a2598bfd5a44", "ja": "なにしろ長いロケだからな。\n途中でへばらないよう、体力温存を心がけるんだ。", "zh": "毕竟录影时间很长，\n为了避免在中途筋疲力竭，应该多注意保留体力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3401_028ari", "source_sha256": "57f69df20b58d0b446f830c4a0c090fba7f66d5f0736f5ffe518b617dcca8357", "ja": "なるほど、体力温存ですか……。\nわかりましたっ。", "zh": "原来如此，好好保留体力吗……\n我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_3402_028ari", "source_sha256": "f63f68fbf87e2568999ff315f03b36fff1c99339e4a078320e0b999b05db1647", "ja": "例え、大好きなアイドルちゃんが隣を駆け抜けて\nいったとしても……絶対に、追いかけませ……んっ！", "zh": "比如说，就算最爱的偶像宝贝从旁边冲过去……\n也绝对、不可以追上……去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
